<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Feb wholesale prices up 12.26 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Feb wholesale prices up 12.26 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 12.26 percent in February year-on-year, compared to 15.74 percent in January, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 0.65 percent to 205.44 from 204.12 in January 1997. The index stood at 177.60 in February 1996.</p>
<p>					 Feb	Jan	     Feb 1996</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICE  base 1990/91  205.44   204.12	  177.60</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +0.65   +2.30	    0.70</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +12.26   +15.74	    n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
